{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026NkW64lycEd1794907738.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>亞洲保齡球錦標賽，港隊麥卓賢及黃鈞源，奪得男子雙打金牌。</p><p></p><p>賽事多哈舉行，個人賽奪銅的麥卓賢與黃鈞源由頭帶到尾，六局總分2839分，贏阿聯酋組合44分奪金。另一港隊組合，以第四名完成。</p><p></p><p>首戰成年組錦標賽事，最左方的青少年代表林諾謙及袁焯軒，僅輸第三的菲律賓組合6分。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:32:19.598680+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T08:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T15:09:16.303042+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:25:43.435823+00:00","content_hash":"34c9c0dcbccdf4eaf8ff1801606d2987917b22d17024677f313bf5db5a97ea7b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}